{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anima is a third-person action RPG that weaves together two fates\u2014one of a legendary monster and a mysterious girl with no memory of her past, the other of an immortal soul cursed to wander the world forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972920/extras/49b13abf5d3e84845739eda1db4908bb.poster.avif?t=1759865943\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972920/extras/49b13abf5d3e84845739eda1db4908bb.webm?t=1759865943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRY THE DEMO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo offers a glimpse into the opening chapters of <strong>Anima: Gate of Memories.</strong> Step into the beginning of Ergo and the Bearer of Calamities\u2019 journey, uncovering the first threads of a story filled with mystery and destiny. Continue your adventure seamlessly in the full game and discover what lies beyond.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Progress made in the demo carries over to the full game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972920/extras/44b1fb41b2281b7b6a9173a0c93d446e.poster.avif?t=1759865943\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972920/extras/44b1fb41b2281b7b6a9173a0c93d446e.webm?t=1759865943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Deep Story:</strong> Uncover the first steps toward the Tower of Arcane and uncover its mysteries. Your choices will shape the fate of both protagonists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Action-Combat with RPG Depth:</strong> Engage in fast-paced battles that blend real-time action with classic RPG mechanics. Perform spectacular combos and strategic attacks using an intuitive, skill-based system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual System &amp; the Hand of Tanathos:</strong> Instantly switch between characters to chain devastating attacks with the Dual System.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Interconnected World:</strong> Explore a world forged from memories and delve into the lives of the Messengers of the End, beings destined to bring about the world\u2019s destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972920/extras/e0912a41380a1cdbde71b714dc4c3fd2.poster.avif?t=1759865943\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972920/extras/e0912a41380a1cdbde71b714dc4c3fd2.webm?t=1759865943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972920?t=1759865943","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972920/e2f3089c0cd9757c9923a5d4b23dcf1c52b59365/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759865943","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972920/2a1e23449cd64aa9e2acda5ad3fee2e4f1df963a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759865943","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972920/2a1e23449cd64aa9e2acda5ad3fee2e4f1df963a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759865943","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements",